# Wake sources masked before every hibernation. One name per line.
# These fire wake events during power-off and roll the hibernation back.
# The machine then comes back up at once, or wedges on the rollback path.
#
# LID is masked on purpose. With LID enabled, opening the lid during the image
# write aborts the hibernation. Masked, the write always completes and the
# machine powers off. Wake it with the power button.
#
# SLPB stays enabled. Never add it here.
XHC0
XHC1
XHC3
XHC4
GPP0
GPP1
GPP3
GPP5
GPP6
NHI0
NHI1
LID
